TITLE Equilibrate pure water with fixed-pressure gas phase at 150 C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7
    pe 4
    units mol/kgw
    water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 150
    CH4(g) 10
    CO2(g) 10
    NH3(g) 5
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -totals C N
USER_PUNCH
    -headings SC_uS_cm
10 PUNCH SC
END
